safix::already_declared

  × ana is already a declared user.
  │ 
  │ Editing an existing person is not what this does.
  │ 
  │ What they hold is safix list ana; changing their recipient is an edit to
  │ flake.safix.users.ana.recipient followed by safix fix, which re-wraps
  │ every
  │ file their audience names and is explicitly not revocation.
